--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY NOTES (cross-platform value parity, NOT a "corrected" version)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  updateStatus useMemo reproduced VERBATIM (branch order preserved): !updateVersion (or "") -> up-to-date ;
    installPct in (0,100) -> installing ; downloadPct in (0,100) -> downloading ; installPct == 100 ->
    installed ; downloadPct == 100 -> ready ; else available. install-in-progress is checked BEFORE
    download; installed (==100) is checked BEFORE ready (==100).
  StatusBadgeSmall config reproduced: up-to-date=success "Up to date" ; available=info "Available" ;
    downloading=warning "Downloading" ; ready=info "Ready" ; installing=warning "Installing" ;
    installed=success "Installed". Badge variants mapped onto Color.TS (success->statusSuccess,
    info->chartSeriesSpeed [web blue badge], warning->statusWarning, neutral->textMuted); the dot uses the
    same tint (web `bg-current`).
  FullView render gates reproduced: current-version row always (version || '—' ; badge on right) ; update
    section iff (updateVersion && status != up-to-date) ; download bar #22d3ee->chartSeriesRegen ; install
    bar #a78bfa->chartSeriesPower ; "Ready to install" row (status==ready) ; Est.-time row iff (isTall &&
    expectedDuration>0) ; Scheduled row iff (isTall && scheduledStart) ; "Up to date" footer iff
    status==up-to-date. ${pct}% rendered without a trailing .0 for whole numbers (JS `${47}` -> "47").
  isCompact = cols<=1 && rows<=1 (defensive parity branch, unreachable under the registry min 1x2, exactly
    as in the web source); isTall = rows>=2. MetricBar fill = min(value,100)/100.
  i18n: every web key present in the catalog (widget.softwareUpdate, widget.noSoftwareData,
    widget.currentVersion, widget.updateAvailable, widget.downloading, widget.installing,
    widget.readyToInstall, widget.estimatedTime, widget.minutes, widget.scheduledStart, widget.upToDate,
    widget.statusUpToDate/Available/Downloading/Ready/Installing/Installed); no English literal ships (all
    via SoftwareUpdateStatusStrings).

